# The revenue ledger is internal: it records prospect company names and, until
# 2026-10-01, their email addresses. It stays on the build box. It was tracked in
# a PUBLIC repository (and had been since 38d8d1e) and was inside the archive
# sold for US$39; both were shipping nine live prospect addresses to anyone who
# asked. The ledger itself is unchanged and still lives here.
REVENUE.md
REVENUE.md.bak-*

# The revenue ledger records prospect company names and, until 2026-10-01, their
# email addresses. It stays on the build box and out of this PUBLIC repository.
REVENUE.md

# Built artifacts belong on the release page, not in git. The .mcpb is
# rebuilt by scripts/mcp_bundle.py on every tag and attached to the release
# the MCP Registry entry points at; committing it would mean two sources of
# truth for the same file and the registry hashes the one it downloads.
dist/bundle/
dist/*.mcpb

# The kit bundle builds into dist/bundle-kit and dist/claimgate-kit-<ver>.mcpb,
# for the same reason as the engine bundle above.
dist/bundle-kit/
dist/*.mcpb

# A local backup made while the builder was refactored to serve two variants.
scripts/mcp_bundle.py.bak-prefork

# uv lockfile for the MCP server environments; not part of the published package.
uv.lock
